Purpose of Information Exchange:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf2 The purpose of this bilateral release of information is to facilitate collaborative care, coordination of services, and communication with authorized organizations and individuals involved in the client's healthcare and support system. It allows for the sharing of information between Monarch Mental Health, treatment centers, psychiatrist offices, general care doctors, lawyers, and family members to ensure comprehensive care and support.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl259\slmult1\sa160\partightenfactor0

