\f1\b\fs20 \cf2 \cb1 Limitations on Use and Disclosures:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf2 The shared information is solely for the purposes outlined in this bilateral release of information form. It may not be further disclosed or used for any other purposes without the explicit consent of the client or as required by law. Once information is disclosed pursuant to this signed authorization, I understand that the general federal privacy law (45 C.F.R., Parts 160 and 164) protecting health information may not apply to the recipient of this information and, therefore, may not prohibit the recipient from re-disclosing it.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 Duration of Authorizations:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf2 This bilateral release of information will remain in effect for one year from the date of signing unless revoked in writing by either party before that date. \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 Revocation:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf2 Either party may revoke this bilateral release of information at any time by providing written notice to the other party. Revocations must be made in writing and sent to Monarch P.O. Box 260120 Lakewood, CO 80226. Revocation will not apply to information that has already been exchanged or used in accordance with this authorization.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf2 Release of Liability:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf2 I release Monarch Mental Health, the recipient of organization(s), and their respective officers, employees, and agents from any liability arising from the disclosure and exchange of information in accordance with this authorization, to the extent permitted by law.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

